## Rules

- Tie every pattern to **this project’s** escrow/settlement story — not generic e-commerce
- Prefer terms from [theory/ArchitecturePatterns.md](../../theory/ArchitecturePatterns.md) and [ARCHITECTURE.md](../../ARCHITECTURE.md)
- **Never** replace the full block with a one-line “Pattern: X + Y”
- After code: walkthrough + verify remain mandatory (AGENTS.md §3 Step E); pattern block can be shorter on repeat mentions **only if** the same pattern was fully explained earlier in the thread

## Workflow placement

- **Before code:** full pattern block(s) → proposal (что / зачем / alternatives / security)
- **After code:** function walkthrough + verification; re-explain pattern only if a new pattern appears
